              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Rebekah Rose Hills"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Really liked this one a lot - poured over a pre-sliced ham for about 20 minutes at 350 and it was delicious. The flavors are sweet and tangy, and worked well in a lot of different ways. We used some of the leftover ham in Egg Cupcakes, some in a quiche - and a lot of it all by itself. Yum!",
