              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "doloresromanowski"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I improvised this basic recipe since I did not have anything except the honey. I used the zest of one clementine and some of the pulp with agave nectar for the marmalade. I used duck sauce for the apricot/peach jam. It still was marvelous. I gave it only 4 stars because I don't know what it would have been like if I used the right ingredients.",
